# Claude Code: keep the directory local by default — sub-agents spawned with
# `isolation: "worktree"` create transient working copies under
# .claude/worktrees/, and personal overrides live in settings.local.json.
# But the *shared* hook config (the Biome Stop-gate) must be checked in so it
# applies to every agent/session, so re-include those specific paths.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
scratchpad/

# Schemathesis writes a per-run cache dir into the repo root when the
# contract-fuzzing leg (`npm run test:schemathesis`) runs locally.
.schemathesis/

# The elixir behavioural runner's warm dependency tree (`run-elixir.mjs` primes
# `deps/` + `_build/` once per distinct dep set and reuses it across cases).  A
# local build cache — ~1.1k files of fetched hex packages — that a `git add -A`
# after a local run will otherwise sweep into the commit.
test/behavioral/.warm/
